  "decisionRules": [
    "Functional/browser success, control response, topology safety and screenshot count remain valid scoped claims but never imply reference anatomy validation.",
    "A generic anatomy source can name structures but cannot authorize subject-specific anchor positions or hidden regions.",
    "Coverage is computed over required (anchor,state,view) cells; repeated evidence from one cell does not cover another.",
    "Each observed anchor must bind to evidenceFrameDigest and carrierKind; a label alone is not geometry identity.",
    "UNKNOWN or OCCLUDED reference regions remain unknown and cannot be filled by candidate measurements or procedural defaults.",
    "The same Producer cannot approve or update the subject reference baseline used to pass its candidate.",
    "Thresholds must be frozen before comparison and identify their measurement source; this Candidate invents no production thresholds.",
    "A machine anatomy pass does not imply manual visual acceptance or USER-ACCEPTED."
